{"ts":"2026-09-25T13:28:04.914Z","author":"harness:claude-anthropic-harness/task-4-ledger","name":"log/20260925T132650Z/000018","body":{"kind":"message","turn":1,"direction":"from_agent","message":{"_type":"AssistantMessage","content":[{"_type":"TextBlock","text":"Onboarding v1.12 is read. It's the highest of 12 versions, 1.01 to 1.12.\n\nYour message was just \"test message\", so I have no task beyond confirming the session works. Here is what I saw.\n\n**Observed**\n- **Tools I have:** Read, Glob, Grep, mcp__calc__add, and the three ledger tools (read, list, write). Glob and Read both worked on the first call. Glob returned the 12 onboarding files in name order, which here matches version order because the minors are zero-padded.\n- **Harness messages:** Each tool result came with system reminders showing tokens left and USD budget. The budget went from $0 to about $0.011 across the two calls, so spend is tracked per call.\n- **No refusals or errors so far.** I haven't tried Grep, the calculator, or the ledger yet, so I have no observations on those.\n- **Environment reminder:** It says \"Bash tool also available\" and describes PowerShell as the primary shell. I have no Bash or shell tool, and my instructions say I must not execute code. This looks like a generic Claude Code environment block that doesn't match my actual toolset. I infer it's boilerplate from the harness, not a real capability.\n- **Onboarding vs. my setup:** Onboarding 1.12 says a variant harness may have a modified toolset and asks that differences be noted in a notebook. I can't write files, so I'm reporting the difference here. I haven't written to the ledger, since you didn't ask me to.\n- **Instructions:** I found nothing malformed in them. The `userEmail` context was not relevant to this task, so I didn't use it.\n\n**Inferred**\n- The session is running normally. The read-only tools work and onboarding is reachable.\n\nI'm ready for a real task. If you'd like these observations saved, I can write them to `pilot/20260925T132650Z/observations`."}],"model":"claude-sonnet-5","parent_tool_use_id":null,"error":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7965,"cache_read_input_tokens":5063,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7965},"output_tokens":609,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"message_id":"msg_011CfQEeAJcCLiovG8FpoNGo","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"8b42230b-c5b6-4792-8f80-224f7ef9efea","uuid":"a42fb061-514c-496d-a87c-f0a1165a438e"}}}
