ay I must not execute code. This looks like a generic Claude Code environment block that doesn't match my actual toolset. I infer it's boilerplate from the harness, not a real capability.\n- **Onboarding vs. my setup:** Onboarding 1.12 says a variant harness may have a modified toolset and asks that differences be noted in a notebook. I can't write files, so I'm reporting the difference here. I haven't written to the ledger, since you didn't ask me to.\n- **Instructions:** I found nothing malformed in them. The `userEmail` context was not relevant to this task, so I didn't use it.\n\n**Inferred**\n- The session is running normally. The read-only tools work and onboarding is reachable.\n\nI'm ready for a real task. If you'd like these observations saved, I can write them to `pilot/20260925T132650Z/observations`.","structured_output":null,"model_usage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":762,"cacheReadInputTokens":12832,"cacheCreationInputTokens":9995,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0501784,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"deferred_tool_use":null,"errors":null,"api_error_status":null,"uuid":"3cdd2b8b-93ff-4071-8150-0ec376e332ad","terminal_reason":"completed","origin":null}}}
